senses.gloss:
सूति 3. सूति, इस्, f. (for स्यूति, fr. rt. सिव्;
for 1. सूति see p. 1117, col. 3; for 2. see p. 1118),
sewing.

सूत्या, f. drinking the Soma juice at a sacrifice;
religious bathing, ablution preparatory or subsequent
to a sacrifice.

सूत्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, strung, arranged, methodized;
ruled, directed or declared in a Sūtra; prescribed or
enjoined in an aphorism, delivered in axioms.
